{
  "abstract": "Lean 4 formalization of the theorem that every torsion-free Abelian group of cardinality continuum admits a Hausdorff countably compact group topology in which every convergent sequence is eventually constant, and constructs a commutative Tychonoff countably compact cancellative topological monoid that is not a group, giving a negative answer to Wallace's question.",
